{"repositoryId":1425659831,"availability":"available","full":"SatinderSinghSall/project-management-frontend","name":"project-management-frontend","description":"A Full-Stack React 19 frontend for a full-stack Project Management System, built with Vite, Tailwind CSS, Redux Toolkit, and Clerk. Features dashboard analytics, project and task management, workspace navigation, team collaboration, and responsive UI components.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-19T13:28:13Z","updated":"2026-10-19T15:47:17Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://project-management-satinder.vercel.app","topics":["axios","clerk","dashboard","frontend","javascript","project-management","project-management-software","project-management-system","react","react-router","reactjs","recharts","redux-toolkit","responsive-design","single-page-applications","tailwindcss","task-management","vercel","vite","web-application"],"demo":"https://project-management-satinder.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T15:56:13.354Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T15:56:13.354Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T15:56:13.354Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T15:56:13.354Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A responsive React application for project planning, task tracking, workspace management, and team collaboration.","This directory contains the frontend for the Project Management System. It is a single-page application built with React and Vite. Its interface is organized into page-level views and reusable components for dashboards, projects, tasks, workspaces, teams, analytics, calendars, and settings.","The frontend integrates Clerk for authentication, Redux Toolkit for shared state, Axios for API communication, Tailwind CSS for styling, Recharts for charts, and supporting libraries for dates, icons, and toast notifications."],"features":["Dashboard: summary statistics, task